## 3. Clinical and privacy boundary

No patient data, sample identifiers, or clinical records are included. This is
a research assistance tool: it is **not** a clinical diagnostic device, and no
output constitutes a clinical conclusion. Every retrieval result carries a
PubMed ID and is intended to be checked item by item; annotation conclusions
are valid only after researcher confirmation.

